SUMMARY: Candlelight: 90s Hip-Hop on Strings
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Candlelight concerts bring the magic of a live\, multi-sens
 ory musical experience to awe-inspiring locations like never seen before 
 in Portland. Get your tickets now to discover the music of 90s Hip-Hop on
  Strings at The Old Church Concert Hall under the gentle glow of candleli
 ght.\n\nGeneral Info\n📍 Venue: The Old Church Concert Hall\n📅 Dates and
  times: select your dates/times directly in the ticket selector\n⏳ Durati
 on: 60 minutes. Doors open 45 minutes before the show. No entry once it s
 tarts.\n👤 Age requirement: 8 years old or older. Anyone under the age of
  16 must be accompanied by an adult\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is ADA c
 ompliant\n❓ View the FAQs for this event here https://docs.google.com/doc
 ument/d/e/2PACX-1vRs-D__FdPjpAauRS7qaQ3ZhqaiH4P3e-CRhZWI4XCpWJLaRMAAO8WfA
 upYjEj8rhTxZE0LzCbO9dpJ/pub\n🪑 Seating is assigned on a first come first
  served basis in each zone\n🕯️ If you would like to book a private conce
 rt or buy regular tickets for a large group (+30 people)\, click here htt
 ps://candlelightexperience.com/groups/#groups-form\n🎻 Check out all the 
 Candlelight concerts https://feverup.com/en/portland/candlelight in Portl
 and\n🎁 To treat your friends and family to a Candlelight gift card\, cli
 ck here https://feverup.com/m/124167\n\nTentative Program\n\n  * Fugees a
 nd Lauryn Hill Medley (Ready or Not\, Doo-Wop\, Fu-Gee-La\, and Killing M
 e Softly)\n  * Jay-Z Medley (Can I Get A…\, Big Pimpin\, Money Ain't a Th
 ing\, and More)\n  * Nas Medley (It Ain't Hard to Tell\, N.Y. State of Mi
 nd\, The World Is Yours\, and More)\n  * Outkast Medley (Rosa Parks\, Ele
 vators (Me & You)\, SpottieOttieDopaliscious\, and More)\n  * Missy 'Misd
 emeanor' Elliott Medley (The Rain (Supa Dupa Fly)\, Sock It to Me\, and M
 ore)\n  * A Tribe Called Quest Medley (Can I Kick It\, Check the Rhime\, 
 Scenario\, and More)\n  * Wu Tang Clan Medley (C.R.E.A.M. (Cash Rules Eve
 rything Around Me)\, Wu-Tang Clan Ain't Nuthing Ta F' Wit\, Protect Ya Ne
 ck\, and More)\n  * 2Pac Medley (Dear Mama\, California Love\, and more)\
 n  * The Notorious B.I.G. Medley (Juicy\, Big Poppa\, Hypnotize\, and Mor
 e)\n  * Dr. Dre Medley (Still D.R.E.\, Forgot About Dre\, Nuthin' but a '
 G' Thang\, and More)\n  * Gin and Juice - Snoop Dogg\n\nPerformers\n\n  *
  String Quartet - Listeso - Portland
