SUMMARY: FREE Lunchtime Concert: David Allred
DESCRIPTION:TOC presents Lunchtime FREE Concerts every FIRST and THIRD We
 dnesday of the month. Our gift to the community for over 56 years\, join 
 us in person or on our Youtube Channel. https://www.youtube.com/channel/U
 CLiO4ZclyOFIe8HiOFzWJyg\n\nPortland-based composer and producer David All
 red will be performing original contemporary classical compositions on th
 e piano\, reminiscent of neoclassical film soundtracks where his music ca
 n be found.\n\nWATCH THE LIVESTREAM https://www.youtube.com/live/UuapAnbF
 LlE?si=K0CVPw3xO3Uyk0AH\n\n\nDavid Allred is a songwriter\, multi-instrum
 entalist and producer based in Oregon. While primarily writing\, recordin
 g and touring internationally as a solo artist\, David has also worked wi
 th Gentle Millennials\, Peter Broderick\, Allred & Broderick\, Heather Wo
 ods Broderick\, Judee Sill\, Good Enough for Grandpa\, Daniel Nickerson\,
  Lana Lou\, La Dispute\, Ann Annie\, Searows\, etc.\n\nwww.davidallredmus
 ic.net/ https://www.davidallredmusic.net/\n\n
