SUMMARY: The Rebel Academy Inaugural Graduation Ceremony!
DESCRIPTION:The Rebel Academy is celebrating its first round of GED and H
 S+ graduates on Sunday\, June 28\, 2026 at The Old Church in downtown Por
 tland! Join our inspiring tutors\, current students\, board members\, vol
 unteers\, and of course\, our amazing students who have defied the status
  quo and completed their high school credentials against all odds. Prepar
 e to be inspired!\n\nThis event is free\, but donations are how we operat
 e. If you are not walking in the ceremony\, please consider a donation to
  help us make this event magical and continue offering our services free 
 of charge to our students.
