SUMMARY: Friends of Chamber Music presents Hamilton & Friends
DESCRIPTION:Join us for two special programs with Hamilton Cheifetz and f
 riends (Sept 27th & Nov 15th) featuring some of the finest musicians from
  our community. Admission is “pay what you will” with a portion of the pr
 oceeds going to support the String Ensemble Community Outreach program wh
 ich features PSU music students in performances at local prisons.\n\nGues
 t artists on September 27 include Jessica Lee (violin)\, Greg Ewer (violi
 n)\, Kenji Bunch (viola)\, James Shields (clarinet)\, Julia Hwakyu Lee (p
 iano)\, and Hamilton Cheifetz (cello)\n\n\n\nProgram: Sunday\, Sept 27th\
 n\nRebecca CLARKE Lullaby and Grotesque for Viola & Cello\nMOZART Clarine
 t Quintet in A Major\, K. 581\nBRAHMS Piano Quintet in F minor\, Op. 34\n
