SUMMARY: The Kirtan Love Experience with Jai Uttal & Friends
DESCRIPTION:Doors at 6:30pm | All Ages | Bar w/ ID | Tickets Early Bird G
 A $35 / GA $45 / DOS $50\n*Pricing Includes all ticketing fees*\n\nKirtan
  Love Experience with Jai Uttal & Friends\n\nStep into an evening of sacr
 ed song with Jai Uttal & Friends\, Grammy-nominated world music visionary
  and beloved pioneer of devotional chanting in the West.\n\nWith his hear
 t-opening voice\, soulful harmonium\, and decades of immersion in the pat
 h of Bhakti\, Jai invites you into a space where music becomes prayer and
  chanting becomes a bridge to the Divine. Surrounded by fellow musicians 
 and friends\, he brings to life a joyful and soulful concert woven with h
 eart-opening kirtan\, inspiring stories\, and sacred rhythms.\n\nWhether 
 you are new to kirtan or a longtime practitioner\, you’ll feel at home in
  this circle of sound. Jai’s music carries the flavors of India\, the sou
 l of Brazil\, the roots of American folk\, and the raw honesty of the dev
 otional heart — weaving a tapestry of sound that is both intimate and exp
 ansive.\n\nCome ready to raise your voice\, to listen deeply\, to be carr
 ied by rhythm and prayer\, and to discover the profound joy of chanting t
 he Divine Names.\n\nKirtan Love Experience with Jai Uttal & Friends — a o
 ne-of-a-kind evening of devotion\, music\, and love.
